DISCLAIMER:

This is an unofficial workaround for FortiClient IPsec VPN configuration on
Linux. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Fortinet, Inc.

Use this software at your own risk. The authors and contributors assume no
responsibility for any damage, data loss, security issues, or other
consequences arising from the use of this software.

Ensure your IT department and security team approve any VPN client
modifications before using this workaround in your organization.

This software does not provide encryption or security guarantees beyond what
FortiClient itself provides. Treat any extracted or modified credentials as
if they were plaintext.
